Thanks for using Wallace! The issue here is that Worldclim data at the 30 arsec resolution is downlodable through R only by tile. Thus, we can only allow downloads of single tiles of 30 arcsec data currently. If you want to use a bigger extent, download the full global dataset, crop it in ArcGIS or QGIS (cropping big rasters is not recommendable in R), then input this data into Wallace as User-specified Environmental Data.

Jamie

